  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme will provide funding to a small number of leading international response organisations in the fields of safety, security, early warning, advice and risk analysis. This network of specialists provide global public goods which improve the overall effectiveness of humanitarian response to both rapid and slow onset humanitarian crises.</narrative>
  </description>
